# Razer
> Razer is a global lifestyle brand for gamers, providing high-performance gaming peripherals, hardware, software, and digital services for PC, console, and mobile platforms.


## Product Categories


### Laptops & PCs
- [Gaming Laptops](https://www.razer.com/gaming-laptops): High-performance laptops designed for gaming, content creation, and streaming with the Razer Blade series.
- [PC Accessories & Desktop Cases](https://www.razer.com/pc/gaming-pc-components): Desktop cases, cooling solutions, and internal/external PC accessories for custom setups.

### Mice
- [Gaming Mice](https://www.razer.com/gaming-mice): High-performance wired and wireless mice tailored for gamers, featuring advanced sensors and customizable settings.
- [Gaming Mice Mat](https://www.razer.com/pc/gaming-mouse-mats): Soft and hard mouse mats are designed to bring out the best in every mouse and playstyle.

### Keyboards
- [Gaming Keyboards](https://www.razer.com/gaming-keyboards): Keyboards designed specifically for gamers, offering customizable RGB lighting and programmable keys.

### Audio Devices
- [Headsets & Earbuds](https://www.razer.com/pc/gaming-headsets-and-audio): Razer's over-ear and on-ear headsets and earbuds deliver immersive sound for gaming, streaming, and communication.
- [Gaming Speakers](https://www.razer.com/pc/gaming-speakers): Speakers, soundbar, and subwoofer packed with high-fidelity, spatial audio for an unrivalled experience that brings your gaming and entertainment to life.

### Content Creation
- [Content Creation](https://www.razer.com/pc/content-creation):Streaming devices, podcast equipment, studio peripherals and other accessories for gamers, streamers, YouTubers, podcasters and influencers.

### Console Gaming Gear
- [Console Gaming Gear and Accessories](https://www.razer.com/console-gaming):Portable console gaming accessories-controllers, headsets, earbuds for PC and console gaming on the go.

### Mobile
- [Mobile Gaming Gear and Audio Accessories](https://www.razer.com/mobile): Phone cases, mobile gaming and lifestyle audio products that seamlessly integrate gaming into every aspect of your life.

### Chairs & Apparel
- [Gear & Apparel](https://www.razer.com/lifestyle): Apparel, bags, and lifestyle merchandise for Razer fans.
- [Gaming Chairs](https://www.razer.com/gaming-chairs): A range of specialized gaming chairs are engineered for your exact needs, offering ergonomic support for posture, all-day comfort for work and play, or breathable mesh to keep you cool.
- [Licensed Collections](https://www.razer.com/lifestyle/collabs): A diverse range of gaming gear and lifestyle accessories through exclusive collaborations with the world's most iconic gaming, pop culture, and lifestyle brands.

### Lighting & Software
- [Chroma RGB](https://www.razer.com/chroma): RGB lighting ecosystem supporting thousands of devices and applications.
- [Synapse Software](https://www.razer.com/synapse): Device configuration, cloud profiles, and macro programming software.
- [Cortex & Performance Tools](https://www.razer.com/cortex): Game optimization, system performance enhancement, and launcher software.

### Payments & Rewards
- [Razer Gold](https://www.razer.com/gold): Digital wallet for purchasing in-game content.

### Store
- [Razer Store](https://www.razer.com/store): Exclusive product drops, bundles, and limited offers available through the official store.

